From: Florian Fortier <florian.f.imp@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:16:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Third-person 3D chase view, Megabonk-style

The camera hangs behind the hero; the mouse (held, pointer hidden) turns
the view and the hero with it, WASD runs where the camera looks, F aims at
a centre crosshair. The boom pulls in when a hill rises behind the hero.
Alt frees the pointer; menus, cards and pause give it back. C cycles
third person, top-down, top-down unlocked. WOW_MOUSE_SENS / ?mouse_sens=.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
